/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-19981" alt="AED CPR Scope of Practice and CME" decoding="async" srcset="https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME.jpg 900w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME-300x200.jpg 300w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME-150x100.jpg 150w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME-768x512.jpg 768w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AED-CPR-Scope-of-Practice-and-CME-400x267.jpg 400w" sizes="(max-width: 709px) 85vw, (max-width: 909px) 67vw, (max-width: 1362px) 62vw, 840px" /></div></a><div class="elementor-post__text"><h3 class="elementor-post__title"> <a href="https://emergencycareny.com/complete-ems-guide/" > NREMT Study Guide: AED CPR Scope of Practice and CME </a></h3> <a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://emergencycareny.com/complete-ems-guide/" aria-label="Read more about NREMT Study Guide: AED CPR Scope of Practice and CME" tabindex="-1" > Read More </a></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><footer data-elementor-type="footer" data-elementor-id="7429" class="elementor elementor-7429 elementor-location-footer" data-elementor-post-type="elementor_library"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ada695 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="4ada695" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-18cd127 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="18cd127" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9367813 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9367813" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-97ab2fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="97ab2fd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img width="368" height="88" src="https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logowhite-2x-full.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-7555" alt="Emergency Care Programs Logo" srcset="https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logowhite-2x-full.png 368w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logowhite-2x-full-300x72.png 300w, https://emergencycareny.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logowhite-2x-full-150x36.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 368px) 85vw, 368px" /></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e01510 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8e01510" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">It’s an emergency, be the one to care.</div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f722e7f e-grid-align-left elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-shape-rounded elementor-grid-0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-social-icons" data-id="f722e7f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="social-icons.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-social-icons-wrapper elementor-grid" role="list"> <span class="elementor-grid-item" role="listitem"> <a class="elementor-icon elementor-social-icon elementor-social-icon-facebook-f elementor-repeater-item-cbe3f73" href="https://www.facebook.com/emergencycareny" target="_blank"> <span class="elementor-screen-only">Facebook-f</span> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i> </a> </span> <span class="elementor-grid-item" role="listitem"> <a class="elementor-ico